  "question": {
    "text": "One end of a straight uniform <math><mn>1</mn><mi></mi><mi>m</mi></math> long bar is pivoted on horizontal table. It is released from rest when it makes an angle <math><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup></math> from the horizontal (see figure). Its angular speed when it hits the table is given as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> , where <math><mi>n</mi></math> is an integer. The value of <math><mi>n</mi></math> is ____________<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/b4c6a5b4-1140-40c3-862c-00ef5c6d4f73.jpeg\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "15",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>according to energy conservation</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br />Solving<br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math><br /><math><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>15</mn></msqrt></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
